sequenceDiagram
  actor You
  participant UI as Renderer
  participant Host as Agent host
  participant Log as Run log
  participant Model as Model provider
  participant Tool as Tool
  You->>UI: Send a message
  UI->>Host: Start a run
  Host->>Log: Commit the message and the run's snapshot
  Host->>Model: Stream a response
  loop Each step
    Model-->>Host: Text, reasoning, tool calls
    Host->>Log: Commit
    Host-->>UI: Publish what was committed
    opt A call needs your decision
      Host->>Log: Commit the request
      Host-->>UI: Approval card
      You->>UI: Allow or deny
      UI->>Host: Your answer
      Host->>Log: Commit the answer
    end
    Host->>Tool: Run the call
    Tool-->>Host: Result
    Host->>Log: Commit the result
  end
  Host->>Log: Commit the outcome
  Host-->>UI: Turn finished, with what it changed
